OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe cause of fire at
OL,4,AGlasgow affordable homes tenement
OL,5,
OL,6,FHousing association NG Homes, which
OL,7,Fowns the block, dismissed the rumours
OL,8,Fand said the flats would provide
OL,9,F"much-needed" homes for people on its
OL,10,Fwaiting list.
